+11. **Multiple subscriptions causing duplicate processing** — Check `hermes teams-pipeline subscriptions` for duplicates. Delete old ones with `delete-subscription <sub-id>`. The pipeline deduplicates by meeting ID, but excess subscriptions waste API quota.
 
